{"id": "ed9c0e6baced8d481b2557948bd2ea3f", "text": "Comments:  In the previous verses the Lord stated that one achieves \nliberation through His grace. In this verse , the Lord goes a step further and \nstates that He is present in the hearts of all living beings  and propels them \ninto action. The Lord uses the word  \u2018yantr\u0101 \u2019 (machine)  to describe  the \nphysical bodies of living beings. Just as a machine relies on an engine for \nrunning, every physical body depends on its heart for proper functioning.", "embedding": [-0.017934152856469154, 0.05548908933997154, -0.006714376620948315, 0.06175518408417702, -0.042806755751371384, -0.02394104190170765, 0.07527725398540497, -0.11313974112272263, 0.011310809291899204, -0.038564376533031464, 0.010117337107658386, 0.037359755486249924, 0.03456231579184532, -0.04030188173055649, 0.05791668966412544, -0.020060624927282333, -0.05287390947341919, -0.017315519973635674, -0.07474656403064728, -0.004359318874776363, 0.042398661375045776, 0.015052522532641888, -0.011169318109750748, -0.02102675847709179, -0.07362977415323257, 0.05819937586784363, -0.0898100957274437, -0.032290320843458176, 0.10998737812042236, -0.10101231187582016, -0.025018149986863136, -0.033774156123399734, 0.037299592047929764, 0.00763797527179122, -0.07817168533802032, 0.14445771276950836, 0.07229673117399216, -0.015802841633558273, -0.07624945044517517, -0.029506545513868332, 0.026556558907032013, -0.06739978492259979, -0.043023448437452316, 0.00553929666057229, 0.09218217432498932, 0.02235194854438305, -0.15319080650806427, -0.05978558957576752, 0.032732006162405014, -0.06770652532577515, -0.11517709493637085, -0.03770005702972412, 0.047988343983888626, 0.07622408121824265, -0.03729691356420517, 0.009352770633995533, 0.009671732783317566, -0.004899375140666962, 0.03926738351583481, -0.08439191430807114, 0.04585067927837372, 0.08502925932407379, 0.01848963461816311, 0.07568822056055069, -0.015023763291537762, -0.07571414113044739, 0.028650